This wooden mine cart will perfectly complement any scene.  Door, hook, wheels and latch of the mine cart are movable and can be animated. The model is detailed and highly optimized, making it suitable for a wide range of uses, It is particularly well suited for creating video games. 
Textures

  - Object is fully textured. All textures are PBR and in png format;

  - All textures have a resolution of 2048 x 2048;

  - Model has the following texture maps: Metallness, Normal (DirectX), Diffuse (BaseColor), Roughness, AO (Ambient Occlusion).

If you have any problems, feel free to message me!

