Fully optimized game ready mesh for pc and console with new and weathered versions, 8 colors, 4K PBR textures. Non overlapping uv maps. Highly detailed geometry.
This pack includes following;
1) A metal barrel mesh with 352 vertices and 700 polygons in common file formats, non overlapping uv unwrapped
2) 72 textures in 4K resolution, PBR workflow including metallic, roughness, normal, height and albedo maps.Textures come in combination of 3 different signs, 8 different colors and weathered/clean versions.All textures are in very common png format.
Example naming for textures;
Barrel_x_mat_Metallic for metallic mapBarrel_x_mat_Roughness for roughness mapBarrel_x_mat_Normal for normal mapBarrel_x_mat_BaseColor for diffuse color/albedo mapBarrel_x_mat_Height for height map
